mission "The Guns of Redoubt"
    name "The Guns of Redoubt"
    description "Sink the four patrol ships at Redoubt Soundings, then return to Redoubt and help the militia restore the signal fort."
    source "Stormhaven"
    destination "Redoubt"
    reward 1050
    objective kills 4
    battlefield "Redoubt Soundings" 15181.1 10270.2
    enemy "Redoubt Soundings Guard 1"
    enemy "Redoubt Soundings Guard 2"
    enemy "Redoubt Soundings Guard 3"
    enemy "Redoubt Soundings Guard 4"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Stormhaven Refuge: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Four Company patrol ships guard the channel below Redoubt and relay signals from the captured fort.`
            `The fort controls the safest passage through the Outer Antilles. If its signal station remains in Company hands, every refuge will be exposed.`
            `The patrol ships sail in pairs. Draw one pair away from the channel before turning your broadside on the second.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The patrol ships sail in pairs. Draw one pair away from the channel before turning your broadside on the second.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Fen gives you a storm lantern. “When the lantern shines from the old tower again, every ship will know the Company has lost its eyes.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Guns of Redoubt. Sink the four patrol ships at Redoubt Soundings, then return to Redoubt and help the militia restore the signal fort."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The signal fort is returned to the islanders. A captured officer says Ashcombe is assembling the Meridian Star and a fleet at Saint's Refuge.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The final Company anchorage lies near Last Light.`
        log "Completed The Guns of Redoubt. Received 1050 gold. The final Company anchorage lies near Last Light."
